# Autonoma Landings Monorepo

Follow `@astro-frontend-starter` skill patterns.

## Structure

- `packages/ui` (`@autonoma/ui`) — shared tokens + UI primitives
- `apps/landing-principal` — approved landing (frozen)
- `apps/landing-arequipa` — Nueva sede Arequipa

## Import direction

```
pages → views → sections → @autonoma/ui | components/layout | components/modals
```

Never reverse this hierarchy.

## Language

- Spanish only (`lang="es"`)
- Home at `/` — no locale prefixes

## Design system

- Use tokens from `@autonoma/ui/styles/global.css` — no raw hex in sections
- Use UI primitives from `@autonoma/ui/components/*`
- Arequipa: content from `src/content/` fixtures (no CMS)

## Before shipping

1. `npm run check:arequipa` / `npm run check:principal`
2. `npm run build:arequipa` / `npm run build:principal`
3. `npm run export:arequipa` for clean HTML handoff
